  "body": "### Summary\nAs a poster, I want \"Editer\" at the top of the \"…\" menu of my own messages, so that fixing a typo is one tap away, as in the published app.\n\nMilestone: M4 (operator, 2026-11-08). Found by the `2440d79..2fe43da3` sweep of #655.\n\n### Legacy @ `2fe43da3`\n`f3b00e66` \"Prioritize edit action for own messages\": `priority(for:)` puts edit before quote when the message is the user's (`HFRswift/Swift/MessagesView.swift:277-300`).\n\n### Current SwiftHFR\n`MessageMenuAction` keeps the `2440d79` order: Citer 0, Citer ☐ 1, Editer 2 (`App/SwiftHFR/Reader/Actions/MessageMenuAction.swift:33-35`).\n\n### Scope\nOrder of the reader's message menu on own messages only; other messages unchanged.\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n- Own message: Editer first, then legacy's order. Other messages: unchanged.\n- A unit test on the ordering for both cases.",
